WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A three-link model runs under a declared, constant joint torque.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
At the intervention time, we copy the state of the model.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
From that copy, a second branch runs with the torque set to zero.

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Solid: the declared-torque run. Dashed: the zero-torque branch.

5
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.000
The gap at the end is a simulated difference inside this model.

6
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.000
It is not a share of speed supplied by the golfer, and not a muscle measurement.
